<title>CHINA: Shanghai hosts meeting on Pacific capital markets.</title>
<headline>Shanghai hosts meeting on Pacific capital markets.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai will host the ninth Pacific Basin capital markets conference from August 25 to 28, the Business News said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Participants from throughout the region and including the heads of the Hong Kong and Tokyo stock exchanges would discuss the reform and internationalisation of China's financial and capital markets, it said.</p>
<p>Other participants would come from Singapore, Malaysia, Indonesia, the Philippines and Thailand, it said.</p>
<p>The meeting had been held annually since 1989 and promoted cooperation and communication between financial experts of Pacific countries, it said.</p>
<p>-- Shanghai Newsroom (8621) 6279-7004</p>
